 "text": "Blodeuwedd rises in Math's fourth Mabinogi branch. Arianrhod cursed Lleu Llaw Gyffes. He would have no wife of any race. Gwydion and Math built her from oak, broom, and meadowsweet blooms. Her name means Flower Face. Blodeuwedd loved the hunter Gronw Pebyr. The pair plotted to kill Lleu. He stayed invulnerable, so they tricked him into exposure. Gronw slew him. Gwydion punished Blodeuwedd by turning her into an owl.",
